# Multi-host Elastic cluster inventory for the SSH deploy (non-ansible option).
# One line per node:  <role>  <ssh-target>  <advertise-ip>
#   role         = es | kibana
#   ssh-target   = user@host that `ssh` can reach
#   advertise-ip = the address other nodes use to reach this one (private IP/DNS)
#
# Enterprise example: 3-7 es + 2 kibana search heads across hosts.
es      ubuntu@10.0.7.11   10.0.7.11
es      ubuntu@10.0.7.12   10.0.7.12
es      ubuntu@10.0.7.13   10.0.7.13
kibana  ubuntu@10.0.7.21   10.0.7.21
